{"path":"ranges/subrange/tuple_element","title":"std::tuple_element<std::ranges::subrange>","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>tuple_element<small>&lt;std::ranges::subrange&gt;</small>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/ranges/subrange/tuple_element","section":"ranges","kind":"page","summary":"The partial specializations of std::tuple_element for std::ranges::subrange provide compile-time access to the iterator or sentinel type of a subrange, using tuple-like syntax.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/ranges\">&lt;ranges&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> I, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> S, <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/subrange_kind\"><span class=\"kw3710\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">subrange_kind</span></span></a> K <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> tuple_element<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nu0\">0</span>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/subrange\"><span class=\"kw2928\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">subrange</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>I, S, K<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> I, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> S, <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/subrange_kind\"><span class=\"kw3710\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">subrange_kind</span></span></a> K <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> tuple_element<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nu0\">0</span>, <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/subrange\"><span class=\"kw2928\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">subrange</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>I, S, K<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\" id=\"Version_3\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> I, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> S, <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/subrange_kind\"><span class=\"kw3710\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">subrange_kind</span></span></a> K <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> tuple_element<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/subrange\"><span class=\"kw2928\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">subrange</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>I, S, K<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (3) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\" id=\"Version_4\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> I, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> S, <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/subrange_kind\"><span class=\"kw3710\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">subrange_kind</span></span></a> K <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> tuple_element<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/subrange\"><span class=\"kw2928\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">subrange</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>I, S, K<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (4) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>The partial specializations of <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/tuple_element\"><code>std::tuple_element</code></a> for <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/subrange\">std::ranges::subrange</a></span> provide compile-time access to the iterator or sentinel type of a <code>subrange</code>, using tuple-like syntax. They are provided for structured binding support.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1,2)</span> Obtains the iterator type, i.e. <code>I</code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">3,4)</span> Obtains the sentinel type, i.e. <code>S</code>.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Member_types\">Member types</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-hitem\">\n<td> Member type\n</td>\n<td> Definition\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <code>type</code>\n</td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-v\">(1,2)</span> <code>I</code><br><span class=\"t-v\">(3,4)</span> <code>S</code>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>As <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/subrange/get\"><code>get</code></a> functions for <code>subrange</code> return iterators and sentinels by value, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">const</span></span></code> qualifier is not added to the result types when the <code>subrange</code> is const-qualified (but not volatile-qualified).\n</p><p>If the <code>subrange</code> is volatile-qualified, the result types are also volatile-qualified because the partial specialization for volatile or const volatile types are used. Such usage is deprecated.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iterator&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;list&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;ranges&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;type_traits&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/list\"><span class=\"kw1283\">std::<span class=\"me2\">list</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> list<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">3</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">4</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">5</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">9</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">2</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">6</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/subrange\"><span class=\"kw2928\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">subrange</span></span></a> subrange\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/counted_iterator\"><span class=\"kw3139\">std::<span class=\"me2\">counted_iterator</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">{</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/begin\"><span class=\"kw681\">std::<span class=\"me2\">begin</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>list<span class=\"br0\">)</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">4</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span>,\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/default_sentinel_t\"><span class=\"kw2897\">std::<span class=\"me2\">default_sentinel</span></span></a>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    static_assert<span class=\"br0\">(</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/types/is_same\"><span class=\"kw592\">std::<span class=\"me2\">is_same_v</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>\n            <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/tuple_element\"><span class=\"kw1108\">std::<span class=\"me2\">tuple_element_t</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nu0\">0</span>, decltype<span class=\"br0\">(</span>subrange<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>,\n            <span class=\"co1\">// implementation-defined type:</span>\n            <a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/counted_iterator\"><span class=\"kw3139\">std::<span class=\"me2\">counted_iterator</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span>_List_iterator<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;&gt;</span>\n            <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    static_assert<span class=\"br0\">(</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/types/is_same\"><span class=\"kw592\">std::<span class=\"me2\">is_same_v</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>\n            <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/tuple_element\"><span class=\"kw1108\">std::<span class=\"me2\">tuple_element_t</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, decltype<span class=\"br0\">(</span>subrange<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>,\n            <a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/default_sentinel_t\"><span class=\"kw2896\">std::<span class=\"me2\">default_sentinel_t</span></span></a>\n            <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/structured_binding\">Structured binding</a> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(C++17)</span>\n</td>\n<td>  binds the specified names to sub-objects or tuple elements of the initializer</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/tuple_element\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>tuple_element</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  obtains the element types of a tuple-like type <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(class template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/subrange/tuple_size\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>std::tuple_size<span class=\"t-dsc-small\">&lt;std::ranges::subrange&gt;</span></span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  obtains the size of a <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/subrange\">std::ranges::subrange</a></span> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(class template specialization)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Member types","id":"Member_types"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"ranges","title":"Ranges library (since C++20)"},{"path":"ranges/subrange","title":"std::ranges::subrange"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::tuple_element<std::ranges::subrange>","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"4 declarations; revisions: since C++20. The partial specializations of std::tuple_element for std::ranges::subrange provide compile-time access to the…"},{"label":"Member types","children":[{"label":"type","note":"(1,2) I(3,4) S"}]},{"label":"Notes","note":"As get functions for subrange return iterators and sentinels by value, const qualifier is not added to the result types when the subrange is const-qualified…"},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"Structured binding (C++17)","note":"binds the specified names to sub-objects or tuple elements of the initializer"},{"label":"tuple_element","note":"obtains the element types of a tuple-like type"},{"label":"std::tuple_size<std::ranges::subrange>","note":"obtains the size of a std::ranges::subrange"}]}]},"standards":["C++11","C++17","C++20"],"wordCount":256,"codeBlockCount":1}
